    {
      "number": "109",
      "text": "109. \u6c42\u4e0b\u5217\u65b9\u7a0b\u7684\u89e3\u96c6\u5408\uff1a\na) $\\frac{2x-5}{x+5}-4=0$\uff1b\nb) $2-\\frac{x^2+3}{x^2+1}=0$\uff1b\nc) $\\frac{3}{2x-1}-\\frac{4}{x+1}=0$\uff1b\nd) $\\frac{x-9}{x-4}+\\frac{x+9}{x+4}=0$\u3002",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "110",
      "text": "110. \u89e3\u65b9\u7a0b\uff1a\na) $\\frac{x^2-4}{x}=\\frac{3+2x}{2}$\uff1b\nb) $\\frac{x^2+5}{2x}=\\frac{3x+10}{6}$\uff1b\nc) $\\frac{2x^2}{3x-5}=x$\uff1b\nd) $\\frac{1+x-6x^2}{3x+1}=x$\uff1b\ne) $\\frac{2x+3}{2x-1}=\\frac{x-5}{x+3}$\uff1b\nf) $\\frac{1+3x}{1-3x}=\\frac{5-2x}{1+2x}$\u3002",
      "figure_ids": []
