      "text": "113. \u6c42\u4e0b\u5217\u65b9\u7a0b\u7684\u89e3\u96c6\u5408\uff1a\na) $\\frac{4}{x}+1=\\frac{x-1}{x+1}$\uff1b\nb) $\\frac{1}{u-1}+3=\\frac{u-3}{2-u}$\uff1b\nc) $\\frac{1}{5-y}-6=\\frac{1-6y}{y}$\uff1b\nd) $\\frac{9}{v}+\\frac{2v-3}{v+1}=2$\u3002",
